{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 42, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark ye traveler bold to lands where cherry blossoms do sway\nUpon the morrow thou shalt alight in Tokyo fair and grand\nWhere neon lights do dance upon streets that never do sleep\nBegin thy days journey at the Shrine of Meiji with hands in prayer\nLinger where ancient gods and modern life do entwine\nTake thou thy fill of matcha sweet at Asakusa’s temple gate\nBargain with merchants in bustling markets at Ameya-Yokocho’s reach.\n\nOn the second morn let steely trains bear thee swift\nTo Kyoto’s grace where temples old do whisper of times past\nAt Kinkaku-ji’s golden pavilion stand and marvel at sunlight’s glow\nThrough bamboo groves at Arashiyama wander with footsteps hushed\nAt Gion’s twilight watch maiko dance with fans in hand\nSup with kaiseki feasts where season’s bounty doth abound.\n\nThe third day shall see thee to Nara’s ancient realm\nWhere deer do prance and toddlers feed them bread with joy\nAt Todai-ji’s great Buddha kneel in reverent awe\nThen let thy feet lead thee to Osaka’s lively embrace\nWhere street food sizzles on grills with flames so bright\nAnd Dotonbori’s signs aglow do lure with promise of delight.\n\nUpon the fourth dawn embark on Shinkansen’s sleek might\nTo Hiroshima’s shores where peace doth dwell in silent light\nAt its Memorial stand with weight of history’s cruel design\nYet let thy heart find solace as flowers bloom anew each spring\nThen sail to Miyajima where torii gate doth rise from the sea\nAnd lanterns glow as waters lap against ancient shore.\n\nThe fifth day shall call thee back to lands of bustling cheer\nIn Osaka or Kobe let thy palate revel in sushi’s art\nOr venture to Takayama where old-world charm doth gleam\nThrough streets of Edo where time hath slowed its pace\nThen to Kanazawa take thee where gardens bloom in quiet grace\nAnd samurai districts hold secrets of yesteryears’ might.\n\nOn the sixth morn let thee awaken in Hakone’s embrace\nWhere hot springs do soothe thy weary bones with vapors’ sweet caress\nAt Lake Ashi’s edge behold Fujisan’s majestic crown\nThen board a rickshaw pulled by horses brown\nTo view the vistas where earth and heaven do entwine\nBefore thy journey’s end in Tokyo’s glow once more thou dost align.\n\nAs twilight falls on thy final eve\nReflect on lands that have captivated thy soul\nWith sushi fresh and sake poured in golden hue\nRaise thy glass high to adventures untold\nFor Japan’s spirit hath left upon thee its mark\nA land of contrast yet bound by harmony’s arc.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.1340528428554535}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.004188099876046181}, {"token": " ye", "logprob": -3.3168089389801025}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.5946138501167297}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0005308172549121082}, {"token": " bold", "logprob": -0.45641690492630005}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -2.490729808807373}, {"token": " lands", "logprob": -1.1358453035354614}, {"token": " where", "logprob": -0.8977378010749817}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -0.05437686666846275}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob": -0.6631470322608948}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.01275618001818657}, {"token": " do", "logprob": -1.1356502771377563}, {"token": " sway", "logprob": -1.4242653846740723}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.1950899064540863}, {"token": "Upon", "logprob": -2.521136522293091}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.5558464527130127}, {"token": " mor", "logprob": -0.6720660924911499}, {"token": "row", "logprob": -0.004126011859625578}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -3.847463846206665}, {"token": " sh", "logprob": -0.18035489320755005}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -8.582700684200972e-05}, {"token": " al", "logprob": -4.513033866882324}, {"token": "ight", "logprob": -5.936446541454643e-05}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.09591744095087051}, {"token": " Tokyo", "logprob": -0.6723282933235168}, {"token": " fair", "logprob":